+++-
+++-    /// Produces a response to a prompt.
+++-    ///
+++-    /// - Parameters:
+++-    ///   - prompt: the prompt
+++-    ///   - image: optional image (for use with VLMs)
+++-    ///   - video: optional video (for use with VLMs)
+++-    /// - Returns: a stream of tokens (as Strings) from the model
